{"id":"watching-what-to-look-at","rev":2,"lang":"lt","status":"published","review_flag":null,"disclaimer":null,"title":"Į ką žiūrėti: taikiniai, dubletai ir pasiruošimo šūviui ritualas","summary":"Išmokite pastebėti taikinio tipą, jo skrydžio liniją, dubleto rūšį ir šaulio ritualą Sporting™ ir Compak® Sporting, kad šūviai nustotų atrodyti vienodi.","body":[{"k":"watching-what-to-look-at-p1","t":"p","html":"Iš pradžių visi šūviai atrodo panašūs: taikinys skrenda, šūvis, šukės. Patyręs žiūrovas mato kur kas daugiau. Parcours de Chasse – Sporting™ ir Compak® Sporting kiekvienas taikinys yra nedidelė mįslė, ir įdomu stebėti, kaip šaulys ją išsprendžia.","disc":null,"rule_ref":null},{"k":"watching-what-to-look-at-p2","t":"p","html":"Pradėkite nuo <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/target/\"><span lang=\"en\">target</span> (taikinio)</a> tipo. Dažniausiai skrenda <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/standard-target/\"><span lang=\"en\">standard target</span> (standartinis taikinys)</a>. <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/midi/\"><span lang=\"en\">Midi</span></a> ir <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/mini/\"><span lang=\"en\">mini / super mini</span></a> yra mažesni ir atrodo toliau, nei yra iš tikrųjų. <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/battue/\"><span lang=\"en\">Battue</span></a> — plonas, plokščias taikinys, kuris skrenda briauna į priekį. <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/rabbit/\"><span lang=\"en\">Rabbit</span> (triušis)</a> rieda ir šokčioja žeme. Dydžiai ir kiti tipai: <a href=\"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/learn/targets-target-types/\">Taikinių tipai</a>.","disc":null,"rule_ref":null},{"k":"watching-what-to-look-at-p3","t":"p","html":"Toliau — <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/trajectory/\"><span lang=\"en\">trajectory</span></a>, taikinio skrydžio kelias. Jis gali skrieti į šaulį: <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/incomer/\"><span lang=\"en\">incomer</span> (artėjantis taikinys)</a>; nuo jo: <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/going-away/\"><span lang=\"en\">going away</span> (tolstantis taikinys)</a>; skersai lauko: <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/crosser/\"><span lang=\"en\">crosser</span> (kertantis taikinys)</a>; šauti beveik tiesiai į viršų: <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/teal/\"><span lang=\"en\">teal</span> (vertikaliai kylantis taikinys)</a>; arba skrieti plačiu lanku: <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/looper/\"><span lang=\"en\">looper</span> (lanku skrendantis taikinys)</a>. Pabandykite įvardyti trajektoriją prieš šūvį. Būtent tai lavina Praktikos žaidimas „Įvardykite skrydį“.","disc":null,"rule_ref":null},{"k":"watching-what-to-look-at-directions","t":"tip","html":"Kairė ir dešinė dažniausiai nurodomos iš šaulio pusės. Jei stovite veidu į šaulį, jo „iš kairės į dešinę“ jums yra iš dešinės į kairę.","disc":null,"rule_ref":null},{"k":"watching-what-to-look-at-p4","t":"p","html":"<a class=\"term\" href=\"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/double/\"><span lang=\"en\">Double</span> (dubletai)</a> yra du taikiniai vienam prašymui: šaulys vieną kartą paprašo ir šauna į abu. Stebėkite juos atskirai. <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/double-on-report/\"><span lang=\"en\">Double on report</span> (dublete pagal šūvio garsą)</a> antrasis taikinys paleidžiamas tada, kai šaulys šauna į pirmąjį. <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/simultaneous-double/\"><span lang=\"en\">Simultaneous double</span> (vienalaikiame dublete)</a> abu taikiniai išlekia tą pačią akimirką. <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/rafale-double/\"><span lang=\"en\">Rafale double</span> (savaiminis dubletas)</a> du taikiniai išlekia iš tos pačios <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/trap/\"><span lang=\"en\">trap</span> (mašinėlės)</a> vienas po kito, ta pačia linija. Daugiau — <a href=\"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/learn/targets-singles-and-doubles/\">Pavienės mišenys ir dubletai</a>.","disc":null,"rule_ref":null},{"k":"watching-what-to-look-at-compare","t":"compare","html":{"sporting":"<a class=\"term\" href=\"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/squad/\"><span lang=\"en\">Squad</span> (grupės)</a> po ne daugiau kaip šeši šauliai eina nuo vienos šaudymo vietos prie kitos per visą stendą. Kiekvienoje vietoje dažniausiai pirma šaudomi pavieniai taikiniai, tada dubletai: pagal šūvio garsą, vienalaikiai ar rafale. <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/stock/\"><span lang=\"en\">Stock</span> (buožė)</a> — šautuvo dalis, kuri atremiama į petį. Kol taikinys nepasirodo, jos viršus turi likti žemiau <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/jacket-line/\"><span lang=\"en\">jacket line</span> (linijos ant liemenės)</a>, nubrėžtos 25 cm žemiau peties ašies (įsivaizduojama linija per abu pečius). Tad gerai matomas visas <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/gun-mount/\"><span lang=\"en\">gun mount</span> (atrėmimas į petį)</a>: kaip šautuvas kyla prie peties ir skruosto.","compak":"<a class=\"term\" href=\"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/squad/\"><span lang=\"en\">Squad</span> (grupė)</a> po ne daugiau kaip šeši šauliai šaudo iš penkių numerių linijoje, į taikinius iš šešių mašinėlių. Šauliai šaudo paeiliui, po penkis taikinius kiekvienas; kai šaulys penktame numeryje baigia, visi persikelia per vieną numerį dešinėn. Dubletai būna pagal šūvio garsą arba vienalaikiai. Kai Compak® Sporting šaulys prašo taikinio, šautuvas gali būti jau prie peties arba dar nuleistas: taisyklės to nereglamentuoja. Tad kai kurie prašo su jau „atremtu“ šautuvu, tai yra prie peties."},"disc":"both","rule_ref":null},{"k":"watching-what-to-look-at-p5","t":"p","html":"Tada stebėkite šaulio <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/pre-shot-routine/\"><span lang=\"en\">pre-shot routine</span> (pasiruošimo šūviui ritualą)</a>: tuos pačius žingsnius tokia pat tvarka prieš kiekvieną taikinį. Daug šaulių nukreipia kojas į <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/break-point/\"><span lang=\"en\">break point</span> (sudaužymo tašką)</a> — vietą, kur planuoja sudaužyti taikinį. Tada nukreipia vamzdžio žiotis į <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/hold-point/\"><span lang=\"en\">hold point</span> (laikymo tašką)</a> — kur šautuvas laukia taikinio. Toliau nukreipia žvilgsnį į <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/pick-up-point/\"><span lang=\"en\">pick-up point</span> (pastebėjimo tašką)</a> — vietą, kur taikinys pirmą kartą aiškiai pamatomas. Tik tada šaulys prašo taikinio: trumpas žodis, pavyzdžiui „pull“, — ir taikinys paleidžiamas. Sekundės gali šiek tiek skirtis; tvarka lieka ta pati.","disc":null,"rule_ref":null},{"k":"watching-what-to-look-at-p6","t":"p","html":"Klausykite ir <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/referee/\"><span lang=\"en\">referee</span> (teisėjo)</a>. Tik teisėjas nusprendžia, ar taikinys pataikytas, ar nepataikytas – <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/zero/\"><span lang=\"en\">Zero</span> (nulis)</a>. Compak® Sporting taisyklės reikalauja, kad teisėjas kiekvieną nulį skelbtų balsu arba garsiniu signalu. Skaičiuokite rezultatą kartu su teisėju, bet savo nuomonę apie jo sprendimą pasilikite sau. Kaip elgtis prie šaudymo vietos — <a href=\"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/learn/watching-at-the-ground/\">Žiūrovas šaudykloje: kur stovėti, kaip fotografuoti ir palaikyti</a>.","disc":null,"rule_ref":null}],"notes":[],"phrases":[],"key_points":[{"k":"watching-what-to-look-at-kp1","html":"Skirkite taikinius: standartinį, midi, mini, battue, triušį.","checklist":false},{"k":"watching-what-to-look-at-kp2","html":"Pabandykite įvardyti trajektoriją prieš šūvį.","checklist":false},{"k":"watching-what-to-look-at-kp3","html":"Dubletai pagal šūvio garsą ir vienalaikiai yra abiejose disciplinose, o rafale — tik Sporting™.","checklist":false},{"k":"watching-what-to-look-at-kp4","html":"Geras ritualas — tie patys žingsniai ta pačia tvarka.","checklist":false},{"k":"watching-what-to-look-at-kp5","html":"Sprendžia tik teisėjas: skaičiuokite kartu, bet nekomentuokite jo sprendimų.","checklist":false}],"did_you_know":{"k":"watching-what-to-look-at-dyk","html":"Dalį skrydžio <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/battue/\"><span lang=\"en\">battue</span></a> matoma tik briauna — plona linija, kurią sunku įžiūrėti. Tada ji pasisuka, parodo plokščią pusę ir greitai krinta. Pažiūrėkite, kaip šauliai renkasi momentą šūviui."},"quiz":[{"k":"watching-what-to-look-at-q1","q":"Kuris taikinys rieda ir šokčioja žeme?","options":[{"k":"a","text":"Battue"},{"k":"b","text":"Midi"},{"k":"c","text":"Rabbit"}],"correct":"c","explain":"Triušis — storas, tvirtas taikinys, ridenamas briauna žeme."},{"k":"watching-what-to-look-at-q4","q":"Kuris dubletas būna tik Sporting™?","options":[{"k":"a","text":"Double on report (dubletas pagal šūvio garsą)"},{"k":"b","text":"Rafale (savaiminis dubletas)"},{"k":"c","text":"Simultaneous double (vienalaikis dubletas)"}],"correct":"b","explain":"Compak® Sporting dubletas būna pagal šūvio garsą arba vienalaikis; rafale yra tik Sporting™.","rule_ref":"sporting:ch4-rafale-double","disc":"both"},{"k":"watching-what-to-look-at-q5","q":"Kas turėtų likti nekintama gerame pasiruošimo šūviui rituale?","options":[{"k":"a","text":"Žingsniai ir jų tvarka"},{"k":"b","text":"Tikslus sekundžių skaičius"},{"k":"c","text":"Rezultatas po kiekvienos vietos"}],"correct":"a","explain":"Daug trenerių pataria tuos pačius žingsnius ta pačia tvarka; laikas gali truputį kisti laiko ribose."}],"terms":[{"id":"target","en":"Target","local":"taikinys","label":"Target (taikinys)","url":"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/target/"},{"id":"standard-target","en":"Standard target","local":"standartinis taikinys","label":"Standard target (standartinis taikinys)","url":"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/standard-target/"},{"id":"midi","en":"Midi","local":"","label":"Midi","url":"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/midi/"},{"id":"mini","en":"Mini / super mini","local":"","label":"Mini / super mini","url":"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/mini/"},{"id":"battue","en":"Battue","local":"","label":"Battue","url":"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/battue/"},{"id":"rabbit","en":"Rabbit","local":"triušis","label":"Rabbit (triušis)","url":"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/rabbit/"},{"id":"trajectory","en":"Trajectory","local":"","label":"Trajectory","url":"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/trajectory/"},{"id":"incomer","en":"Incomer","local":"artėjantis taikinys","label":"Incomer (artėjantis taikinys)","url":"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/incomer/"},{"id":"going-away","en":"Going away","local":"tolstantis taikinys","label":"Going away (tolstantis taikinys)","url":"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/going-away/"},{"id":"crosser","en":"Crosser","local":"kertantis taikinys","label":"Crosser (kertantis taikinys)","url":"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/crosser/"},{"id":"teal","en":"Teal","local":"vertikaliai kylantis taikinys","label":"Teal (vertikaliai kylantis taikinys)","url":"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/teal/"},{"id":"looper","en":"Looper","local":"lanku skrendantis taikinys","label":"Looper (lanku skrendantis taikinys)","url":"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/looper/"},{"id":"double","en":"Double","local":"dubletas","label":"Double (dubletas)","url":"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/double/"},{"id":"double-on-report","en":"Double on report","local":"dubletas pagal šūvio garsą","label":"Double on report (dubletas pagal šūvio garsą)","url":"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/double-on-report/"},{"id":"simultaneous-double","en":"Simultaneous double","local":"vienalaikis dubletas","label":"Simultaneous double (vienalaikis dubletas)","url":"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/simultaneous-double/"},{"id":"rafale-double","en":"Rafale double","local":"savaiminis dubletas","label":"Rafale double (savaiminis dubletas)","url":"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/rafale-double/"},{"id":"squad","en":"Squad","local":"grupė","label":"Squad (grupė)","url":"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/squad/"},{"id":"jacket-line","en":"Jacket line","local":"linija ant liemenės","label":"Jacket line (linija ant liemenės)","url":"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/jacket-line/"},{"id":"gun-mount","en":"Gun mount","local":"šautuvo atrėmimas į petį","label":"Gun mount (šautuvo atrėmimas į petį)","url":"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/gun-mount/"},{"id":"pre-shot-routine","en":"Pre-shot routine","local":"pasiruošimo šūviui ritualas","label":"Pre-shot routine (pasiruošimo šūviui ritualas)","url":"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/pre-shot-routine/"},{"id":"hold-point","en":"Hold point","local":"ginklo laikymo taškas","label":"Hold point (ginklo laikymo taškas)","url":"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/hold-point/"},{"id":"break-point","en":"Break point","local":"sudaužymo taškas","label":"Break point (sudaužymo taškas)","url":"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/break-point/"},{"id":"referee","en":"Referee","local":"teisėjas","label":"Referee (teisėjas)","url":"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/referee/"},{"id":"zero","en":"Zero","local":"nulis","label":"Zero (nulis)","url":"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/zero/"},{"id":"trap","en":"Trap","local":"mašinėlė","label":"Trap (mašinėlė)","url":"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/trap/"},{"id":"stock","en":"Stock","local":"buožė","label":"Stock (buožė)","url":"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/stock/"},{"id":"pick-up-point","en":"Pick-up point","local":"taikinio pastebėjimo taškas","label":"Pick-up point (taikinio pastebėjimo taškas)","url":"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/pick-up-point/"}],"rule_refs":[{"book":"sporting","id":"ch2-targets","label":"Skyrius 2","url":"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/rules/en/sporting/?lang=lt#ch2-targets"},{"book":"sporting","id":"ch4-double-on-report","label":"Skyrius 4","url":"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/rules/en/sporting/?lang=lt#ch4-double-on-report"},{"book":"sporting","id":"ch4-simultaneous-double","label":"Skyrius 4","url":"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/rules/en/sporting/?lang=lt#ch4-simultaneous-double"},{"book":"sporting","id":"ch4-rafale-double","label":"Skyrius 4","url":"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/rules/en/sporting/?lang=lt#ch4-rafale-double"},{"book":"sporting","id":"ch16-squads","label":"Skyrius 16","url":"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/rules/en/sporting/?lang=lt#ch16-squads"},{"book":"sporting","id":"ch16-singles-then-doubles","label":"Skyrius 16","url":"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/rules/en/sporting/?lang=lt#ch16-singles-then-doubles"},{"book":"sporting","id":"ch3-ready-position","label":"Skyrius 3","url":"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/rules/en/sporting/?lang=lt#ch3-ready-position"},{"book":"sporting","id":"ch3-jacket-line","label":"Skyrius 3","url":"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/rules/en/sporting/?lang=lt#ch3-jacket-line"},{"book":"sporting","id":"ch6-referee-alone","label":"Skyrius 6","url":"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/rules/en/sporting/?lang=lt#ch6-referee-alone"},{"book":"compak","id":"ch3-targets","label":"Skyrius 3","url":"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/rules/en/compak/?lang=lt#ch3-targets"},{"book":"compak","id":"ch3-double-on-report","label":"Skyrius 3","url":"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/rules/en/compak/?lang=lt#ch3-double-on-report"},{"book":"compak","id":"ch3-simultaneous-double","label":"Skyrius 3","url":"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/rules/en/compak/?lang=lt#ch3-simultaneous-double"},{"book":"compak","id":"ch17-squad-rotation","label":"Skyrius 17","url":"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/rules/en/compak/?lang=lt#ch17-squad-rotation"},{"book":"compak","id":"ch17-gun-position","label":"Skyrius 17","url":"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/rules/en/compak/?lang=lt#ch17-gun-position"},{"book":"compak","id":"ch15-zero-announce","label":"Skyrius 15","url":"https://fenix-112323.github.io/clayaway/rules/en/compak/?lang=lt#ch15-zero-announce"}],"sources":[{"title":"FITASC — official rules of Parcours de Chasse – Sporting™ and Compak® Sporting","url":"https://www.fitasc.com/disciplines-sportives/reglements-sportifs","fitasc":true}],"evidence":[],"more_in_en":0}
